"""Club questions for the 2026-27 League One clubs.
Entry: (difficulty 1-3, kind, question, correct, [3 wrong], explanation[, page override]).
Every fact was checked against the source page on 2026-11-04. Wrong options are written to be plainly wrong for the question asked."""
